but that the film, quote, gives a distorted view of how social media platforms work to create a convenient scapegoat for what are difficult and complex societal problems.

1062
02:35:18,560 --> 02:35:20,600
Trust on what do you have to say to that?

1063
02:35:22,140 --> 02:35:22,500
Yeah.

1064
02:35:22,600 --> 02:35:28,060
