1078
02:36:14,100 --> 02:36:18,500
So many kids right now are online doing virtual school, including my own.

1079
02:36:18,500 --> 02:36:24,680
Let's say, for example, they're researching a controversial moment in history, like dictators or conspiracy theories.

1080
02:36:24,880 --> 02:36:27,659
Will that affect the information that gets recommended to them?

1081
02:36:28,920 --> 02:36:29,960
Yeah, that's a great question.

1082
02:36:30,560 --> 02:36:35,100
It's hard for us to know all the nuance of what's going on with these algorithms,

1083
02:36:35,100 --> 02:36:39,260
in large part because they are these private algorithms driven by these private companies.

1084
02:36:39,680 --> 02:36:44,820
But what we do know is that the responses are based on the profile that is created of us.

1085
02:36:45,140 --> 02:36:48,420
An example we use in the film is around this phrase, climate change is.

1086
02:36:48,500 --> 02:36:55,079
And if you search the phrase climate change is in Google, you will get different answers based on who you are.

1087
02:36:55,780 --> 02:36:59,659
There's an amazing book called Algorithms of Oppression that came out as well.

1088
02:36:59,700 --> 02:37:06,079
That is about how we see the same patterns within the racist constructs that exist on the Internet.

1089
02:37:06,079 --> 02:37:17,320
And so the algorithms are going to give you these personalized views, these personalized responses based on who you are with no real sense of an objective truth.

1090
02:37:17,320 --> 02:37:17,760
Wow.

1091
02:37:18,260 --> 02:37:20,140
Well, here's a question.

1092
02:37:20,659 --> 02:37:27,500
Do we need to, if we delete social media, like I keep telling my kids, just go to the library.

1093
02:37:27,500 --> 02:37:49,340
Is it really realistic?

1094
02:37:34,355 --> 02:37:42,275
