1132
02:40:00,515 --> 02:40:07,876
It is, and I don't say this lightly, I would contend the most consequential documentary I have seen in the past three or four years.

1133
02:40:07,876 --> 02:40:16,896
This echo chamber that has led to the tribalism that we have in our country, social media gave us the echo chamber and they show you precisely how it's been done.

1134
02:40:17,015 --> 02:40:18,175
